   Single-file Java Swing application implementing:
    - Role-based login (Admin / Technician / Researcher)
    - User management (Admin)
    - Inventory management (Admin/Tech)
    - Maintenance logs (Technician)
    - Requests & approval workflow (Researcher -> Admin/Technician)
    - Samples CRUD (Tech/Admin), Researcher requests to submit samples
    - Results CRUD (Tech/Admin)
    - Equipment reservations with scheduling conflict checks
    - Search/filtering, colored interactive UI
    - Persistence via Java serialization to files
    - CSV and simple HTML export (printable)
    - SHA-256 simple password hashing
    - Demo credentials created on first run
*/

